OL,5,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,6,     FBob visits Dr Sam Savage,
OL,7,     Fconcerned about his memory loss. A
OL,8,     Fthorough test has surprising
OL,9,     Fresults. After an operation years
OL,10,     Fago, Winston still has infected
OL,11,     Fwounds that haven't healed.
OL,12,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,13,     FIt's an emotional last day for
OL,14,     Fnurse Bryony: after two years,
OL,15,     Fshe's moving to pastures new, but
OL,16,     Fnot before a good old Barnsley
OL,17,     Fsend-off from all her casualty
OL,18,     Fcolleagues.
