OL,5,G2100 A&E After Dark
OL,6,     FPolice bring in an abusive male
OL,7,     Funder arrest who claims he has a
OL,8,     Fracing heart, and two friends
OL,9,     Farrive in resus who have
OL,10,     Fdislocated each other's shoulders
OL,11,     Fduring a friendly wrestle.
OL,12,G2200 Ambulance: Code Red
OL,13,     FA pair of air ambulance teams
OL,14,     Frespond to a serious accident
OL,15,     Fwhere one passenger was thrown out
OL,16,     Fwhile the driver remains trapped.
