OL,5,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,6,     FA young veteran needs Dr Magnus's
OL,7,     Fhelp with a condition affecting
OL,8,     Fhis eyelids. And Dr Natalia
OL,9,     Fstruggles with a lipoma on the
OL,10,     Fjawline of a joker who won't stop
OL,11,     Ftalking.
OL,12,G0000 Killer at the Crime Scene
OL,13,     FAfter a brutally murdered oil rig
OL,14,     Fworker is found in a burnt-out
OL,15,     Fcar, the quiet Scottish town soon
OL,16,     Fbecomes inflamed with rumours and
OL,17,     Ffear.
